Lab 12: Analyze Job Performance with Insights
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Configure and enable Red Hat Insights integration with Ansible Automation Platform • Monitor automation job execution times, resource usage, and error patterns • Analyze performance metrics using Insights dashboard and reporting features • Identify performance bottlenecks and optimization opportunities • Implement performance improvements based on Insights recommendations • Create custom performance monitoring workflows for continuous optimization

Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

• Basic understanding of Ansible playbooks and automation concepts • Familiarity with Red Hat Ansible Automation Platform (AAP) interface • Knowledge of Linux command line operations • Understanding of system performance monitoring concepts • Completed previous labs in the Managing Enterprise Automation series • Access to Red Hat Customer Portal account (for Insights registration)

